{"step_index":105,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T00:14:41Z","thinking":"The retrieved business information confirms the company name \"토탈소프트뱅크\" and includes the address \"부산광역시 해운대구 반송로 513\". This matches the CSV entry, with minor differences in street address formatting. The address in the snippet appears to contain an abbreviated version.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Inspect Saramin search results\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"const fs = require('fs');\\n\\nasync function testSaramin(name) {\\n    const url = 'https://www.saramin.co.kr/zf_user/search/company?searchword=' + encodeURIComponent(name);\\n    const res = await fetch(url, {\\n        headers: {\\n            'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36'\\n        }\\n    });\\n    const html = await res.text();\\n    // find company links\\n    const matches = [];\\n    const regex = /<a\\\\s+href=\\\"(\\\\/zf_user\\\\/company-info\\\\/view\\\\?csn=[^\\\"]+)\\\"[^>]*>([\\\\s\\\\S]*?)<\\\\/a>/gi;\\n    let m;\\n    while ((m = regex.exec(html)) !== null) {\\n        matches.push({ link: m[1], text: m[2].replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '').trim() });\\n    }\\n    console.log(`Saramin for ${name}: found ${matches.length} companies:`, matches.slice(0, 5));\\n}\\n\\ntestSaramin('토탈소프트뱅크');\\ntestSaramin('모두싸인');\\n\"","Description":"\"Inspect Saramin search results\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2\\\\scratch\\\\test_saramin.js\"","toolAction":"\"Inspect Saramin search\"","toolSummary":"\"Inspect Saramin search\""}}]}
